DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261027T103000
SUMMARY:Triple P® Seminar: The Power of Positive Parenting (birth to 6 yea
 rs old)
LOCATION:3990 14th Avenue\, Markham\, ON L3R 0B2
DESCRIPTION:This small group seminar is for parents and caregivers who have
  ever wondered "Why does my child do that?" It will help you understand th
 e reasons children do what they do\, so you can guide their behaviour and 
 see more of the behaviour you like\, and less of the behaviour you do not 
 like. It’s a great way to connect with other families and educators.\n\n
 **Triple P VIRTUAL Seminar 1. Link to join will be provided in advance.**\
 n*Note: If you register AFTER October 22\, please email earlyonmarkham@fam
 ilydaycare.com to request the link to join.*\n\nOther Triple P Seminars th
 is month:\n* Triple P Virtual Seminar 2 (Raising Confident\, Competent Chi
 ldren): Wed. October 28\, 9-10:30am\n* Triple P Virtual Seminar 3 (Raising
  Resilient Children): Thurs. October 29\, 9-10:30am\n\nPre-registration re
 quired\, Virtual\n\nCentre: EarlyON Markham Centre\n\nSource: https://www.
 missioninc.com/cso/york/en-ca/earlyon/calendar
URL:https://www.missioninc.com/cso/york/en-ca/earlyon/calendar
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
