BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:91bc7c260ff4f479@earlyon-cal
DTSTAMP:20261030T134735Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261102T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261102T153000
SUMMARY:Baby and Me (birth to 12 months)
LOCATION:7755 Bayview Avenue\, Thornhill\, ON L3T 4P1
DESCRIPTION:You and your baby are invited to join us for songs\, rhymes\, a
 nd experiences designed to help you connect with your baby. Enjoy engaging
  conversations and information sharing on healthy child development. It's 
 a great way to connect with your baby\, other families and educators.\n\n*
 *Baby and Me - Baby Motor Milestones & Play **\nSpecial Guest: Jennifer Ha
 lfin\, PT\, MSc(A)PT  from Toronto Kids Physio \n\nJoin physiotherapists f
 rom Toronto Kids Physio for an interactive and informal session on baby mo
 tor development! Learn practical tips on tummy time\, rolling\, sitting\, 
 crawling\, and how to encourage movement through everyday play. We will al
 so cover baby equipment guidance and simple strategies for head shape and 
 neck tightness. Bring your questions for an open Q&A!\n\nDrop-in\n\nCentre
 : EarlyON Thornhill Centre\n\nSource: https://www.missioninc.com/cso/york/
 en-ca/earlyon/calendar
URL:https://www.missioninc.com/cso/york/en-ca/earlyon/calendar
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
