UID:3db4bc513e1cc936@earlyon-cal
DTSTAMP:20261030T134735Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261103T090000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261103T103000
SUMMARY:Triple P® Seminar: The Power of Positive Parenting (birth to 6 yea
 rs old)
LOCATION:3990 14th Avenue\, Markham\, ON L3R 0B2
DESCRIPTION:This small group seminar is for parents and caregivers who have
  ever wondered "Why does my child do that?" It will help you understand th
 e reasons children do what they do\, so you can guide their behaviour and 
 see more of the behaviour you like\, and less of the behaviour you do not 
 like. It’s a great way to connect with other families and educators.\n\n
 **Triple P VIRTUAL Seminar 1 in MANDARIN. Link to join will be provided in
  advance.**\n*Note: If you register AFTER October 29th\, please email earl
 yonmarkham@familydaycare.com to request the link to join.*\n\nOther Triple
  P Seminars this month:\n\n* Triple P Virtual Seminar 2 (Raising Confident
 \, Competent Children): Wed. November 4\, 9-10:30am\n* Triple P Virtual Se
 minar 3 (Raising Resilient Children): Thurs. November 5\, 9-10:30am\n\nPre
 -registration required\, Virtual\n\nCentre: EarlyON Markham Centre\n\nSour
 ce: https://www.missioninc.com/cso/york/en-ca/earlyon/calendar
URL:https://www.missioninc.com/cso/york/en-ca/earlyon/calendar
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
