 ter AFTER October 29\, please email earlyonmarkham@familydaycare.com to re
 quest the link to join.*\n\nOther Triple P Seminars this month:\n\n* Tripl
 e P Virtual Seminar 1 (The Power of Positive Parenting): Tues. November 3\
 , 9-10:30am\n* Triple P Virtual Seminar 3 (Raising Resilient Children): Th
 urs. November 5\, 9-10:30am\n\nPre-registration required\, Virtual\n\nCent
 re: EarlyON Markham Centre\n\nSource: https://www.missioninc.com/cso/york/
 en-ca/earlyon/calendar
